{"channelId":"UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","row":["Catherine Haggerty",1540,"Thank you for taking time to visit my channel. My name is Catherine & I love following my heart, animals, & striving to live a healthier lifestyle....although pizza 🍕 is still my favorite all time food. I’m also in continual pursuit of finding the best tasting mocha latte ☕️\n\nI enjoy trying new recipes, tips, & kitchen tricks, riding horses, & spending time with my epileptic dog,  Frankie. I also started investing in 2017 and wish I would have listened to my Dad when I was in my 20s (don't we all - hahahaha). I lean on God during the hard times and enjoy his guidance and blessings in the good and bad times. \n\nAnyway, this is my journey and I am so happy you have decided to stop in to \"see\" what I am up to. Take care & God bless!!\n\n** some posts contain affiliate links and I earn a small commission from them. Thank you for your support 😊","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:00.947Z","channelId":"UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"da6a2362d9e078d6c6089675583a32690a85cf910b91e40e347c8d98dc4ad9ad","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3dc0b3c4e7a424949550c9b2fafe298053c927007b224570cdd87194e75bb74b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:00.947Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1540,"raw":"1.54K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyAD4vKO4XWylIddRCG8JUA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:00.947Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","